/--
The actual iid Definition 2 Model B recursion, instantiated as a reusable
projected stochastic-subgradient minimizer-set execution.  Every stochastic
field here is derived from the joint law of component weights and ideal points;
in particular, no independence within a sampled voter is assumed.
-/
noncomputable def weightedEuclideanJointSampleCanonicalMinimizerSetExecution
    {Voter Coord Component : Type*} [Fintype Coord] [Fintype Component]
    {E : ILVEnvironment Voter (Coord → ℝ)}
    (D : WeightedEuclideanJointSampleData Coord Component)
    {project : (Coord → ℝ) → Coord → ℝ}
