/--
The joint law of the actual state and its fresh ideal draw is the product of
the state law and the C3 ideal law.  This is the product-law form of the
fresh-sampling bridge used for future expected-subgradient and moment steps.
-/
theorem finiteModelBOutcomeTrajectory_idealSample_pair_law
    {Coord : Type*} [Fintype Coord]
    (D : FiniteCoordinateIdealDistributionData Coord)
    (p r0 : ℝ) (project : (Coord → ℝ) → Coord → ℝ)
    (initial : Coord → ℝ) (hproject : Measurable project) (n : ℕ) :
